From c94ed7622f4a2bb30fc165d124eaad2799098781 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raold <868138+raold@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:01:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Split Valithria's adds between the tanks and kill them in
 order

Playerbots.ValithriaAdds (default 1).

With 0021 the dojo 10-heroic raid lost both tanks at 161-206 s. The warrior held every zombie that the
skull and the stock tank pick sent him (195-202k of zombie melee), Gut Spray landed on everyone in front
of an abomination (the dream-cloud multiplier blocked tank face), worms piled on whichever tank stood
nearest, the skull waited on archmages while a skeleton's Lay Waste burned the whole room (up to 394k
raid damage), half the Frostbolt Volleys landed (202k) and neither tank used a defensive cooldown in
the whole pull.

- The tanks split her adds (RaidInteractions::VdwTankHolds): the first by guid holds the abominations,
  the second the archmages, skeletons and blistering zombies (a heroic zombie one-shot a kiting damage
  dealer), both share the rot worms, a tank taking another stray worm only while it holds no more than
  the other; a lone tank holds them all. A tank's own target leaves out what it does not hold unless
  it is on it, and every suppresser (RaidIccStrategy::AppendTargetExclusions).
- Tank face runs for a tank on an abomination, so its Gut Spray points away from the raid.
- One skull in kill order (VdwKillRank): skeleton, zombie, rot worms, suppressers, archmages, the
  abomination last; worms and suppressers are marked where the most stand, so area spells hit the
  pile; a mark moves only to a more urgent kind. Melee never takes a zombie and fights the best melee
  target while the skull is one.
- icc valithria interrupt (ACTION_RAID + 6): warriors, rogues, mages, shamans, hunters and death
  knights interrupt the nearest Frostbolt Volley in reach.
- icc valithria tank cooldown (ACTION_EMERGENCY + 1): Shield Block, Shield Wall, Last Stand; Divine
  Protection, Lay on Hands; Vampiric Blood, Icebound Fortitude; Barkskin, Survival Instincts, each
  below its health line (stock Shield Wall sat at ACTION_MEDIUM_HEAL, under the rotation).
- No crowd control on a zombie a tank holds.
- valithria_watch gains adds= (also on its end line).
- ValithriaAdds = 0 restores the 0021 behaviour exactly.
